      answer: 'Yes. APRA says CPS 234 (Information Security) and CPS 230 (Operational Risk Management) set requirements on information security, third party and service provider risk, incident response and testing that directly affect enterprise software design. We design the controls your compliance team needs to evidence, and we can provide the information your compliance team needs to assess us as a supplier. The formal determination that APRA\'s requirements are satisfied sits with your compliance function, not with us.',
